// avatarPersonas.memql
//
// Operator-curated avatar persona catalog. The SeedMaterializer turns
// each row into a v1:agents:avatarPersona the Create-Assistant picker
// lists (frontend#239); the agent's avatarVendor/avatarPersonaId point
// at the chosen entry and the voice-agent resolves it at session start
// (integrations/avatarvendor/dispatch.go resolveSimliPlan -> Simli faceId,
// authenticated by MEMQL_SIMLI_API_KEY).
//
// SIMLI ONLY (memql#1239). Anam is render-blocked for us (its ephemeral
// client-audio session hard-caps at ~26-27s -- escalation memql#1236), so
// the product catalog is exclusively CUSTOM Simli avatars we generate from
// our own operator images. avatarPersonas ALSO hard-filters
// vendor=="simli", so only Simli entries can ever surface in the product.
// The Anam stock personas (Mia / Liv / Gabriel / Finn) were removed here.
//
// HAND-CURATED, and growing as we generate avatars in Simli. personaId is
// the Simli faceId (POST /generateFaceID for the source image); paste it in
// when adding a persona. (The Anam-era cmd/avatar-mint generator was retired
// in memql#1242 -- the catalog is hand-curated seeds now.)
//
// Source images are served by the product SPA at /avatars/<name>.png. We have
// three operator images: female_0 (live below as Sofia) plus two MALE
// images whose Simli faces are not yet generated -- add their seeds here
// once minted.

use agents.concepts.{ avatarPersona }

// Sofia -- our one custom Simli avatar, generated from avatars/female_0.png.
// personaId is the Simli faceId, validated against POST /compose/token
// (HTTP 200). The earlier d6ee6443 value was rejected INVALID_FACE_ID
// (memql#1239), so the avatar never came up; ab2f2d4b is the valid face.
@description("Avatar persona Sofia (female) -- custom Simli avatar from avatars/female_0.png (memql#1237; faceId corrected memql#1239).")
seed avatarPersona sofia {
  vendor:     "simli"
  personaId:  "ab2f2d4b-779b-40b7-be72-d4c69c136642"
  name:       "Sofia"
  gender:     "female"
  imageRef:   "avatars/female_0.png"
  previewRef: "/avatars/female_0.png"
}

// Pending (operator images exist in the product SPA's /avatars; Simli faces not yet
// generated): the two male images. Add
//   seed avatarPersona <name> { vendor: "simli" personaId: "<faceId>" ... }
// here once their faceIds are minted in Simli.
